{"id":"417601da4a2602ecdaa1773f022dd2da25600f73","axis":"silent","repo":"pnpm/pnpm","sha":"417601da4a2602ecdaa1773f022dd2da25600f73","parsed":{"files":[{"path":".changeset/tolerate-unreadable-requires-python.md","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@","+---","+\"pacquet\": patch","+\"@pnpm/pnpr\": patch","+---","+","+Python resolution no longer fails on a release whose `Requires-Python` is not a version specifier, such as the trailing comma in `openpyxl` 3.0.x. pnpm now reads such a value as if the release declared no interpreter range [#14910](https://github.com/pnpm/pnpm/issues/14910)."],"additions":6,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"Cargo.lock","lines":["@@ -5808,6 +5808,7 @@ dependencies = [","  \"serde\",","  \"serde_json\",","  \"ssri\",","+ \"tracing\",","  \"url\","," ]"," "],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"cspell.json","lines":["@@ -269,6 +269,7 @@","     \"oomol\",","     \"openharmony\",","     \"openpgp\",","+    \"openpyxl\",","     \"ossl\",","     \"outfile\",","     \"overrider\","],"additions":1,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"pnpm/crates/cli/tests/suite/python.rs","lines":["@@ -86,12 +86,25 @@ async fn serve_with_index_auth(","     name: &str,","     versions: &[(&str, Vec<u8>)],","     authorization: Option<&str>,","+) -> Vec<mockito::Mock> {","+    let versions = versions","+        .iter()","+        .map(|(version, archive)| (*version, archive.clone(), None))","+        .collect::<Vec<_>>();","+    serve_files(server, name, &versions, authorization).await","+}","+","+async fn serve_files(","+    server: &mut mockito::ServerGuard,","+    name: &str,","+    versions: &[(&str, Vec<u8>, Option<&str>)],","+    authorization: Option<&str>,"," ) -> Vec<mockito::Mock> {","     let mut mocks = Vec::new();","     let mut files = Vec::new();","-    for (version, archive) in versions {","+    for (version, archive, requires_python) in versions {","         let filename = format!(\"{name}-{version}-py3-none-any.whl\");","-     